    "description": "What: a manned M2 engages an intruder (CE-4035 G-11), on basic-desert. 'M2 Gunner' (default SOP) sets up a stowed 'M2 HMG' 8 m away at (300, 330), facing north; while it is set up an 'Intruder' (Hostile) walks from (330, 480) toward it (to (310, 400)). The gunner's own SOP engages from the seat (CE-4035: a man in a weapon system's seat is not 'aboard' — the weapon has no brain, W-D; before, the 'Aboard → the vehicle decides' row left nobody to fire — 📐 measured live). Judge: (1) the gunner mans the M2 and it deploys (2) the M2 fires on the intruder. Fail: the M2 never fires. Note: split out of ua-weapon-systems, whose automatic sentry gun (360° traverse, 900 m range) shot every intruder anywhere on the terrain first. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch ua-m2-engage"
